abstract: >-
  A proof of Conjecture 1 of Maja Petrović, Branko Malešević, and Bojan Banjac:
  the taxicab Erdős–Mordell inequality for all nondegenerate triangle
  orientations and strictly interior points, with sharp coefficient 3/2.
  By Chris Ozols, with AI-assisted proof development and formalization.
  Verified with Lean 4.35.0 and Mathlib v4.35.0. No claim of established
  worldwide priority.
keywords:
  - taxicab geometry
  - Erdős–Mordell inequality
  - Lean
  - Mathlib
